# Contrat API WebSocket — Lobby & Game Services

## Connexion

Les deux services requièrent un JWT au handshake :
```javascript
io('http://host:port', { auth: { token: accessToken } })
```

---

## LOBBY-SERVICE (port 3001)

### Events client → serveur

| Event | Payload | Description |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| `lobby:create` | `{ gameMode: "CLASSIC"|"LINKED", gameType: "SOLO"|"TEAM_UP", maxUsers: 3|4|5|6 }` | Crée un lobby privé |
| `lobby:join` | `{ lobbyId: "A3F9K2" }` | Rejoint un lobby existant |
| `lobby:ready` | `{ lobbyId: "A3F9K2" }` | Toggle ready/pas ready |
| `lobby:start` | `{ lobbyId: "A3F9K2" }` | Lance la partie (hôte uniquement) |

### Events serveur → client

| Event | Payload | Destinataire | Description |
|-------|---------|-------------|-------------|
| `lobby:created` | `{ lobbyId: "A3F9K2" }` | Créateur uniquement | Lobby créé, voici le code |
| `lobby:joined` | `{ lobbyStruct }` | Tout le lobby | Un joueur a rejoint |
| `lobby:readyChanged` | `{ lobbyStruct }` | Tout le lobby | Un joueur a toggle ready |
| `lobby:disconnected` | `{ userId: "uuid" }` | Reste du lobby | Un joueur a quitté |
| `lobby:gameStarting` | `{ gameId: "uuid" }` | Tout le lobby | Partie créée, connectez-vous au game-service |
| `error` | `"message d'erreur"` | Socket concerné | Erreur |

### Structure lobbyStruct
```json
{
  "lobbyId": "A3F9K2",
  "lobbyType": "PRIVATE",
  "creatorId": "user-uuid",
  "createdAt": 1710000000000,
  "state": "WAITING|FULL|GAME_STARTED",
  "gameId": null,
  "users": [
    { "id": "user-uuid", "ready": false }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "gameMode": "CLASSIC|LINKED",
    "gameType": "SOLO|TEAM_UP",
    "maxUsers": 3
  },
  "teams": {}
}
```

